    <selectionEntry name="Manos the Mad" id="f8e9-87f7-bff2-64fc" collective="false" hidden="false" import="true" type="unit">
      <costs>
        <cost name="pts" typeId="4ed5-2f92-9abc-2870" value="60"/>
      </costs>
      <infoLinks>
        <infoLink name="Manos the Mad" id="0627-67b2-ff47-dc84" hidden="false" targetId="1dc6-d538-c363-2008" type="profile"/>
        <infoLink name="Close Combat Weapon" id="8565-4c3b-84db-6527" hidden="false" targetId="46d5-85f2-d932-f0a2" type="profile"/>
      </infoLinks>
      <profiles>
        <profile name="The Flames of Blood" id="7549-85db-3399-9b81" hidden="false" typeId="b399-8a1b-bf0b-c5b7" typeName="Weapon">
          <characteristics>
            <characteristic name="Range" typeId="deb8-131d-bdcf-1376">Template</characteristic>
            <characteristic name="S" typeId="24d8-2110-08fa-d844">4</characteristic>
            <characteristic name="AP" typeId="25ce-028f-0aae-2855">3</characteristic>
            <characteristic name="Type" typeId="d3f6-19e8-ac9e-ae13">Assault 1</characteristic>
            <characteristic name="Abilities" typeId="492d-1f80-b777-26f2"/>
          </characteristics>
        </profile>
        <profile name="The Eye of Judgement" id="fd64-946d-ea2a-9439" hidden="false" typeId="b399-8a1b-bf0b-c5b7" typeName="Weapon">
          <characteristics>
            <characteristic name="Range" typeId="deb8-131d-bdcf-1376">12&quot;</characteristic>
            <characteristic name="S" typeId="24d8-2110-08fa-d844">5</characteristic>
            <characteristic name="AP" typeId="25ce-028f-0aae-2855">1</characteristic>
            <characteristic name="Type" typeId="d3f6-19e8-ac9e-ae13">Assault 1</characteristic>
            <characteristic name="Abilities" typeId="492d-1f80-b777-26f2">Special</characteristic>
          </characteristics>
        </profile>
      </profiles>
      <rules>
        <rule name="Brazier of Damnation" id="4500-3d7a-73aa-8fc3" hidden="false">
          <description>Manos has a 5+ cover save at all times, allowing him to strike first as if in cover. If Manos joins a Cult unit, each member of the unit gains +1 I and +1 A in the first round of an Assault.</description>
        </rule>
        <rule name="The Eye of Judgement" id="9e04-4186-c632-c14f" hidden="false">
          <description>The Eye of Judgement targets the closest enemy model in any direction, and fires even if Manos used his flamer. It cannot target models that do not have Ld score, so if that is the closest it will target the bext closest. The Eye of Judgement hits automatically, but the target must pass a Leadership test, or they take a Strength 5 hit with no saves allowed.</description>
        </rule>
        <rule name="Crown of Iron" id="166f-ff09-05aa-9c69" hidden="false">
          <description>Manos cannot be wounded by ranged weappons with a Strength lower than his Toughness. He can still be wounded as normal by Sniper Rifles or other weapons that wound without comparing Strength &amp; Toughness.</description>
        </rule>
      </rules>
    </selectionEntry>
    <selectionEntry name="Janos Armistadt" id="51ef-a65a-726b-34b1" collective="false" hidden="false" import="true" type="upgrade">
      <costs>
        <cost name="pts" typeId="4ed5-2f92-9abc-2870" value="107"/>
      </costs>
      <infoLinks>
        <infoLink name="Independent Character" id="d51e-78aa-22e4-6875" hidden="false" targetId="4a60-7f7e-c37f-a4d6" type="rule"/>
        <infoLink name="Janos Armistadt" id="6594-22f9-ca60-d4e6" hidden="false" targetId="4249-ef3f-e13e-fa90" type="profile"/>
        <infoLink name="Bolt Pistol" id="81d4-c3bb-1dd6-b107" hidden="false" targetId="e9ac-c779-51bb-3c9a" type="profile">
          <modifiers>
            <modifier field="name" type="set" value="Master Crafted Bolt Pistol"/>
          </modifiers>
        </infoLink>
        <infoLink name="Hypnotic Gaze" id="1b37-dec5-2a67-72cc" hidden="false" targetId="7480-6633-9906-f11b" type="rule"/>
      </infoLinks>
      <rules>
        <rule name="He Who Runs Away..." id="fac0-e20d-a45e-806c" hidden="false">
          <description>The Magus can make a Voluntary Fall-back by making a successful Leadership Test, leaving his Bodyguard to keep on fighting in an Assault. He will automatically Regroup after this movement has ended, or if he reaches the edge of the board. Janos may also choose to flee the table altogether. If he does so, he will not count for Victory Points, but he does count for being dead for other Cult special rules.</description>
        </rule>
        <rule name="Refractor Field" id="89ab-c926-340d-8146" hidden="false">
          <description>Gain a 5+ invulnerable save</description>
        </rule>
        <rule name="Test of Wills" id="4f23-dff4-f6ef-158a" hidden="false">
          <description>Use this power at the start of the Cult player&apos;s assault phase against a single enemy model within 6&quot; within LOS. If the psychic test is passed, both Janos and the target model roll 2D6 and add their Leadership. If Janos&apos;s total is higher, he can then make a normal Assault mode with the model. The Assault Phase is then conducted as normal, but the target model counts as being in the Cult Army for the rest of the phase.

The power will only work on living creatures, so Vehicles, Daemons, Necrons, Thousand Sons, Avatars, Wraithguard, etc. cannot be effected. Tyranids of any type are not effected by the power either.</description>
        </rule>
        <rule name="The Shephard&apos;s Staff" id="d971-389c-6ef1-0131" hidden="false">
          <description>The Staff counts as a Power Weapon, but requires two hands to use so no other combat bonuses for extra attacks can be used. The Staff also counts a Sacred Item.</description>
        </rule>
        <rule name="The Serpent&apos;s Tooth" id="bfb4-0465-9b9b-f690" hidden="false">
          <description>Grants Rending Claws ability to Janos</description>
        </rule>
      </rules>
      <selectionEntryGroups>
        <selectionEntryGroup name="Bodyguard" id="c9dc-1b5a-2383-f7df" collective="false" hidden="false" import="true">
          <constraints>
            <constraint id="070a-80f3-4981-7d11" field="selections" includeChildForces="false" includeChildSelections="false" percentValue="false" scope="parent" shared="true" type="max" value="1"/>
          </constraints>
          <selectionEntries>
            <selectionEntry name="Protectorate Bodyguard" id="9636-c6ec-d5aa-ed36" collective="false" hidden="false" import="true" type="upgrade">
              <costs>
                <cost name="pts" typeId="4ed5-2f92-9abc-2870" value="0"/>
              </costs>
              <entryLinks>
                <entryLink name="Cult Limousine" id="b720-b8b4-fb24-b6d9" collective="false" hidden="false" import="true" sortIndex="5" targetId="0330-4681-ecb1-08a9" type="selectionEntry">
                  <constraints>
                    <constraint id="9c6e-d32d-8832-94f0" field="selections" includeChildForces="false" includeChildSelections="false" percentValue="false" scope="parent" shared="true" type="max" value="1"/>
                  </constraints>
                  <modifiers>
                    <modifier field="hidden" type="set" value="true">
                      <conditions>
                        <condition childId="model" field="selections" includeChildForces="false" includeChildSelections="true" percentValue="false" scope="51ef-a65a-726b-34b1" shared="true" type="greaterThan" value="8"/>
                      </conditions>
                    </modifier>
                  </modifiers>
                </entryLink>
              </entryLinks>
              <rules>
                <rule name="We Fall So That He May Live" id="807c-ca63-e1a2-032e" hidden="false">
                  <description>Bodyguards will never Fall Back for any reason. When the unit is hit by ranged fire, the Cult player may apply up to 3 hits per Bodyguard Initiate before having to allocate any hits on the Magus. In an assault, after all models have moved the Cult player may swap the Magus with another Bodyguard Initiate model. The same thing can be done when the unit is hit by any template or area effect weapons.</description>
                </rule>
              </rules>
              <selectionEntries>
                <selectionEntry name="Cult Relic" id="b9be-ce0e-7faa-c5b9" collective="false" hidden="false" import="true" sortIndex="3" type="upgrade">
                  <constraints>
                    <constraint id="d1ff-aad3-fba0-deeb" field="selections" includeChildForces="false" includeChildSelections="false" percentValue="false" scope="parent" shared="true" type="max" value="1"/>
                  </constraints>
