        <selectionEntry name="Patriach Ichor Vial" id="20f8-3c49-8ec8-fde7" collective="false" hidden="false" import="true" type="upgrade">
          <constraints>
            <constraint id="3b23-75f4-5e28-6894" field="selections" includeChildForces="false" includeChildSelections="false" percentValue="false" scope="parent" shared="true" type="max" value="1"/>
            <constraint id="2b79-2497-8b58-d73a" field="selections" includeChildForces="false" includeChildSelections="false" percentValue="false" scope="force" shared="true" type="max" value="1"/>
          </constraints>
          <costs>
            <cost name="pts" typeId="4ed5-2f92-9abc-2870" value="40"/>
          </costs>
          <rules>
            <rule name="Patriach Ichor Vial" id="82cf-57ef-6ad4-59f4" hidden="false">
              <description>Once per battle at any time in the Assault Phase the bearer my shatter the vial. All Cult members belonging to any units with at least one model or open-topped vehicles within 2D6&quot; of the bearer are filled with fanatical zeal. Roll once on the table below to see what effect occurs. This effect wears off at the end of the current turn.
1: +1 I
2: +1 A
3: +1 S
4: +1 WS
5: Re-roll Misses
6: Re-roll failed wounds and vehicle armour pen</description>
            </rule>
          </rules>
        </selectionEntry>
        <selectionEntry name="Scanner" id="83e0-ec89-022c-bb9b" collective="false" hidden="false" import="true" type="upgrade">
          <constraints>
            <constraint id="0423-229b-6b80-450e" field="selections" includeChildForces="false" includeChildSelections="false" percentValue="false" scope="parent" shared="true" type="max" value="1"/>
          </constraints>
          <costs>
            <cost name="pts" typeId="4ed5-2f92-9abc-2870" value="5"/>
          </costs>
          <modifiers>
            <modifier field="hidden" type="set" value="true">
              <conditionGroups>
                <conditionGroup type="and">
                  <conditions>
                    <condition childId="1bf3-367b-b566-54b6" field="selections" includeChildForces="false" includeChildSelections="false" percentValue="false" scope="parent" shared="true" type="notInstanceOf" value="0"/>
                    <condition childId="c406-23d3-1c02-6e7f" field="selections" includeChildForces="false" includeChildSelections="false" percentValue="false" scope="parent" shared="true" type="notInstanceOf" value="0"/>
                  </conditions>
                </conditionGroup>
              </conditionGroups>
            </modifier>
          </modifiers>
          <rules>
            <rule name="Scanner" id="616e-3aed-9a92-45f2" hidden="false">
              <description>If enemy infiltrators set up with 4D6&quot; of a model with a surveyor then the model is allowed to take a &apos;free&apos; shot at them. If the model is part of a unit, the whole unit may shoot. These shots are taken before the battle begins and may cause the infiltrators to fall back.</description>
            </rule>
          </rules>
        </selectionEntry>
        <selectionEntry name="Targeter" id="8690-1a4b-dc93-eeb8" collective="false" hidden="false" import="true" type="upgrade">
          <constraints>
            <constraint id="ad5d-430e-3cbd-f53e" field="selections" includeChildForces="false" includeChildSelections="false" percentValue="false" scope="parent" shared="true" type="max" value="1"/>
          </constraints>
          <costs>
